      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她没有在『阪神两岁雌马大赛』出场，\n而是打算参加『朝日杯未来锦标』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c70e4aaa5a4ae2a932b135c6705d150bfaf09ff6d9989969a62ed99c42b6d12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
